PLAYING AND CONFIGURATION

You may download, install, and play with my mods. You may keep personal backup
copies and edit configuration files for your own setup.

You may share configuration files you edited and original presets you made,
including through a modpack or collection. These files must not contain my
code, scripts, plugins, assets, or other mod files. Credit my mod and link to
its official download when sharing files made for it. Original presets and
