and other third-party monetisation require my prior written permission.

A modpack or collection may reference my mod and arrange downloads from its
official page through that site's supported tools. This does not allow anyone
to bundle, mirror, or upload my mod files with the pack. Only configuration
files may be edited under this permission, except for the fix-submission
process below.

